{"nodes": [{"id": "$graphify-root$_worked_karpathy_repos_readme_md", "label": "README.md", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "page", "source_file": "worked/karpathy-repos/README.md", "source_location": "L1", "display_label": "Note:README", "text": ""}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_worked_karpathy_repos_readme_karpathy_repos_benchmark", "label": "Karpathy Repos Benchmark", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "worked/karpathy-repos/README.md", "source_location": "L1", "display_label": "Heading:Karpathy Repos Benchmark", "heading_level": 1, "text": "# Karpathy Repos Benchmark\n\nThis is the corpus that produced the **71.5x token reduction** benchmark."}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_worked_karpathy_repos_readme_corpus_52_files", "label": "Corpus (52 files)", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "worked/karpathy-repos/README.md", "source_location": "L5", "display_label": "Heading:Corpus (52 files)", "heading_level": 2, "text": "## Corpus (52 files)"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_worked_karpathy_repos_readme_code_clone_these_3_repos", "label": "Code \u2014 clone these 3 repos", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "worked/karpathy-repos/README.md", "source_location": "L7", "display_label": "Heading:Code \u2014 clone these 3 repos", "heading_level": 3, "text": "### Code \u2014 clone these 3 repos\n\n```bash\ngit clone https://github.com/karpathy/nanoGPT\ngit clone https://github.com/karpathy/minGPT\ngit clone https://github.com/karpathy/micrograd\n```"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_worked_karpathy_repos_readme_papers_download_these_5_pdfs", "label": "Papers \u2014 download these 5 PDFs", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "worked/karpathy-repos/README.md", "source_location": "L15", "display_label": "Heading:Papers \u2014 download these 5 PDFs", "heading_level": 3, "text": "### Papers \u2014 download these 5 PDFs\n\n- Attention Is All You Need \u2014 https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.03762\n- FlashAttention: Fast and Memory-Efficient Exact Attention \u2014 https://arxiv.org/abs/2205.14135\n- FlashAttention-2 \u2014 https://arxiv.org/abs/2307.08691\n- Neural Attention Residuals \u2014 https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.03840\n- NeuralWalker: Graph Neural Networks with Walk-Based Attention \u2014 https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.02593"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_worked_karpathy_repos_readme_images_save_these_4", "label": "Images \u2014 save these 4", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "worked/karpathy-repos/README.md", "source_location": "L23", "display_label": "Heading:Images \u2014 save these 4", "heading_level": 3, "text": "### Images \u2014 save these 4\n\n- `gpt2_124M_loss.png` \u2014 nanoGPT training loss curve (in the nanoGPT repo)\n- `gout.svg` \u2014 micrograd computation graph (in the micrograd repo)\n- `moon_mlp.png` \u2014 MLP decision boundary (in the micrograd repo)\n- Any screenshot or diagram from the Attention Is All You Need paper"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_worked_karpathy_repos_readme_how_to_run", "label": "How to run", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "worked/karpathy-repos/README.md", "source_location": "L30", "display_label": "Heading:How to run", "heading_level": 2, "text": "## How to run\n\nPut all files into a single folder called `raw/`:\n\n```\nraw/\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 nanoGPT/\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 minGPT/\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 micrograd/\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 attention.pdf\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 flashattention.pdf\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 flashattention2.pdf\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 attn_residuals.pdf\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 neuralwalker.pdf\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 gpt2_124M_loss.png\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 gout.svg\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 moon_mlp.png\n```\n\nInstall and set up the skill for your platform:\n\n```bash\npip install graphifyy\n\ngraphify install                        # Claude Code\ngraphify install --platform codex       # Codex\ngraphify install --platform opencode    # OpenCode\ngraphify install --platform claw        # OpenClaw\n```\n\nThen open your AI coding assistant in this directory and type:\n\n```\n/graphify ./raw\n```"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_worked_karpathy_repos_readme_what_to_expect", "label": "What to expect", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "worked/karpathy-repos/README.md", "source_location": "L66", "display_label": "Heading:What to expect", "heading_level": 2, "text": "## What to expect\n\n- ~285 nodes, ~340 edges, ~17 meaningful communities\n- God nodes: `Value` (micrograd), `GPT` (nanoGPT), `Training Script`, `Layer`\n- Surprising connections: nanoGPT Block and minGPT Block linked across repos, FlashAttention paper bridging into CausalSelfAttention in both repos\n- Token reduction: 71.5x vs reading all 52 files directly\n\nActual output is in this folder: `GRAPH_REPORT.md` and `graph.json`. Full eval with scores: `review.md`."}], "edges": [{"source": "$graphify-root$_worked_karpathy_repos_readme_md", "target": "$graphify-root$_worked_karpathy_repos_readme_karpathy_repos_benchmark", "relation": "contains", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "source_file": "worked/karpathy-repos/README.md", "source_location": "L1", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "$graphify-root$_worked_karpathy_repos_readme_karpathy_repos_benchmark", "target": "$graphify-root$_worked_karpathy_repos_readme_corpus_52_files", "relation": "contains", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "source_file": "worked/karpathy-repos/README.md", "source_location": "L5", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "$graphify-root$_worked_karpathy_repos_readme_corpus_52_files", "target": "$graphify-root$_worked_karpathy_repos_readme_code_clone_these_3_repos", "relation": "contains", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "source_file": "worked/karpathy-repos/README.md", "source_location": "L7", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "$graphify-root$_worked_karpathy_repos_readme_corpus_52_files", "target": "$graphify-root$_worked_karpathy_repos_readme_papers_download_these_5_pdfs", "relation": "contains", "confiden